<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">Please refer enclosed pdf of Financial Results for Notes on Financial Results.   Clarification for Cash Flow Indirect:   1.In the statement of consolidated unaudited financial results filed with stock exchanges  “Statement”),  Share of Net Profit of a Joint Venture Accounted for using the Equity Method  has been shown as line item after  Profit before Share of Profit of a Joint Venture, Exceptional Items and Tax  . Whereas Profit before tax considered here in the  Cash Flow Indirect  is before the  Share of Net profit of a Joint Venture Accounted for using the Equity Method . Hence, Profit before tax of Rs. 1139.06 Crore given here is not matching with Profit before Tax of Rs. 1286.85 Crore. In view of above, Adjustments for share of Profit of a Joint Venture of Rs. 147.79 Crore given in Consolidated statement of cash flows for the six months ended filed with Stock Exchange is not shown here.   2. Adjustments for Decrease/ (Increase) in Other Assets of Rs. 4.55 Crore in Consolidated Statement of Cash flows filed with Stock exchange is bifurcated here into Adjustments for decrease (increase) in other current assets of Rs. 3.83 Crore and Adjustments for decrease (increase) in other non-current assets of Rs. 0.72 Crore.   3. Adjustments for Decrease/(increase) in Other Financial Assets of Rs. 133.63 Crore in Consolidated Statement of Cash flows filed with Stock exchange is bifurcated into Adjustments for other financial assets, non-current of Rs. 0.06 Crore and Adjustments for other financial assets, current of Rs. 133.57 Crore.   4.  Adjustments for Increase/ (Decrease) in Other Liabilities and Provisions of Rs. 25.71 Crore in Consolidated Statement of Cash flows filed with Stock exchange is bifurcated into Adjustments for (increase) decrease in other current liabilities of Rs. 24.31 Crore, Adjustments for (increase) decrease in other non-current liabilities of Rs. (0.54) Crore, Adjustments for provisions, current of Rs. (3.70) Crore, Adjustments for provisions, non current of Rs. 1.43 Crore and Adjustments for other financial liabilities, current of Rs. 4.21 Crore.   5. Other adjustments for which cash effects are investing or financing cash flow of Rs. 41.18 Crore is the sum of (Gain) on sale of Current Investments of Rs. (3.48) Crore, Effective portion of Exchange Difference Loss on Hedging Instruments re-classified to Profit or Loss of Rs. 44.16 Crore and Loss on Disposal of Property, Plant and Equipment (Net) of Rs. 0.50 Crore.   6.Other adjustments for non-cash items of Rs. (6.45) Crore is the sum of Allowance for Doubtful Debts and Advances (Net) of Rs. (0.66) Crore, Catalyst Charges written off of Rs. 4.38 Crore, Mark to Market Loss/(Gain) on Derivative Transactions of Rs. (9.84) Crore and Liabilities no longer required written back of Rs. (0.33) Crore.   Adjustments for cash flow from investing activities:   7.Purchase of Property, Plant and Equipment &amp; Intangible Assets of Rs. 85.69 Crore in Consolidated Statement of Cash flows filed with Stock exchange is bifurcated here into Purchase of Property, plant and equipment of Rs. 84.22 Crore, Purchase of Intangible Assets of Rs. 0.81 Crore and Purchase of Intangible assets under development of Rs. 0.66 Crore   8.Other Inflows/(Outflows) of cash  of Rs. (651.49) Crore is the sum of Proceeds from sale of Current Investments of Rs. 3.48 Crore, Purchase of current investments of Rs. (655.00) Crore and Fixed Deposits Matured (having original maturity of more than three months) of Rs. 0.03 Crore given in Consolidated Statement of Cash flows filed with Stock exchange.   Adjustments for cash flow from financing activities:   9. Proceeds from exercise of stock options given here  represents Receipt of amount from CFCL Employees Welfare Trust of Rs. 1.25 Crore given in Consolidated Statement of Cash flows filed with Stock exchange.</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
